#. ~ Description for WS-47G moisture retention suit
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The WebbStar moisture retention suit utilizes advanced technology to prevent"
" up to 30% of moisture loss through perspiration.  The suit is powered by "
"the micro-motions of the body, especially breathing and walking motions.  "
"Because of this your walking speed is impaired while wearing it."
msgstr ""
