#. ~ Description for frankfurters & beans entree
#: lang/json/COMESTIBLE_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The dreaded four fingers of death.  It seems to be several decades old.  "
"Sterilized using radiation, so it's safe to eat.  Exposed to the atmosphere,"
