#. ~ Description for pool ball
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A colorful, hard ball.  Essentially a rock."
msgstr "Разноцветный твёрдый шар. По сути, камень."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
