"              .........\n"
"              .........\n"
"              ..#....**\n"
"              ..#Ov..**\n"
"              ...O|....\n"
"\n"
"Protecting your field with a sturdy picket fence will keep most wildlife from nibbling your crops apart.  You can expect yields to increase."
